---
title: Ylva - durable session representations and offline maintenance
config:
  layout: elk
---

stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    %% Sources: store.rs, store/{archive,maintenance}.rs.
    %% Conceptual storage lifecycle, not TuiMode or an exhaustive error-state machine.

    state "Durable representation (offline maintenance, not TuiMode)" as Representation {
        [*] --> Raw
        Raw --> Archived : Explicit compress under identity lock / verify before removing raw
        Archived --> Raw : Explicit decompress or resume restores writable transcript
        Raw --> Deleted : Explicit delete / selectors and shared references checked
        Archived --> Deleted : Explicit delete / selectors and shared references checked
        Deleted --> [*]

        note right of Archived
            Lossless gzip + metadata sidecar; not context compaction.
            Listing/replay/clone can read archives without changing the source.
            Active writer locks exclude maintenance.
            Divergent or corrupt representations fail explicitly.
        end note
    }
